msgstr "控管"

msgid "MISSION_FUTURECITY_MEDAL_2_TEXT"
msgstr ""
"交通科技測量系統可以用於記錄住民的行動模式。\n"
"如此一來，您就有機會監控城市居民了。"

msgid "MISSION_FUTURECITY_MEDAL_3_CAMPAIGNSCREENNAME"
msgstr "東方明珠電視塔"

msgid "MISSION_FUTURECITY_MEDAL_3_FINISH_NAME"
msgstr "已建造建築物"

msgid "MISSION_FUTURECITY_MEDAL_3_FINISH_TEXT"
msgstr ""
"目標達到了。\n"
"建築物順利完成。"

